  "results": {
    "real_chain": "Competing spend succeeds; own and newer foreign replay abort with exit152. Native source/outbound/inbound proof selects own attempt. Only winner changes commitments38->41/nullifiers25->27; liability2000000000,reserved0. SIGKILL/restart recovers refusal; no fee import, input locks released; cached replay twice with RPC unavailable.",
