    "complete_history": "18 authenticated predecessor-linked transactions, two RPC pages. Earlier single-page replay failed completeness. Pagination fixed; no node-pruning claim.",
    "python": "141 tests passed with umask077, native emulator and signer prerequisites supplied. Earlier incomplete environment runs are not acceptance.",
    "native": "25 tests passed; clippy all-targets -D warnings, fmt, ruff passed.",
    "source_guards": "64 host +2 runtime suites passed on exact feature checkout. Runtime uses pinned engineSHA8ca8b37e and Ubuntu24 imageSHA8211dd79.",
